  put("A furnace puts out 72,000 BTU/h with a 50°F temperature rise. About how much air is it moving?", {q: T("A furnace puts out 72,000 BTU/h with a 50°F temperature rise. About how much air is it moving?", "Un horno entrega 72.000 BTU/h con un aumento de 50°F. ¿Cuánto aire mueve aproximadamente?"), a: [T("1,333 CFM", "1.333 CFM"), T("720 CFM", "720 CFM"), T("2,400 CFM", "2.400 CFM"), T("3,600 CFM", "3.600 CFM")], c: 0, why: T("72,000 ÷ (1.08 × 50) = 72,000 ÷ 54 ≈ 1,333 CFM.", "72.000 ÷ (1,08 × 50) = 72.000 ÷ 54 ≈ 1.333 CFM."), wrong: ["", T("Not 720 CFM. The right call is 1,333 CFM.", "No es 720 CFM. La correcta es 1.333 CFM."), T("Not 2,400 CFM. The right call is 1,333 CFM.", "No es 2.400 CFM. La correcta es 1.333 CFM."), T("Not 3,600 CFM. The right call is 1,333 CFM.", "No es 3.600 CFM. La correcta es 1.333 CFM.")], tip: T("72,000 ÷ (1.08 × 50) = 72,000 ÷ 54 ≈ 1,333 CFM.", "72.000 ÷ (1,08 × 50) = 72.000 ÷ 54 ≈ 1.333 CFM.")});
