  put("How much clear space should you keep around the outdoor unit?", {q: T("How much clear space should you keep around the outdoor unit?", "¿Cuánto espacio libre debes dejar alrededor de la unidad exterior?"), a: [T("About 2 feet", "Unos 60 cm (2 pies)"), T("None, hide it with plants", "Nada, tápala con plantas"), T("2 inches", "5 cm"), T("Cover it with a tarp in summer", "Cúbrela con una lona en verano")], c: 0, why: T("It needs to pull air in through its sides. Crowding it makes it work harder.", "Necesita jalar aire por los lados. Si la encierras, trabaja más."), wrong: ["", T("Not None, hide it with plants. The right call is About 2 feet.", "No es Nada, tápala con plantas. La correcta es Unos 60 cm (2 pies)."), T("Not 2 inches. The right call is About 2 feet.", "No es 5 cm. La correcta es Unos 60 cm (2 pies)."), T("Not Cover it with a tarp in summer. The right call is About 2 feet.", "No es Cúbrela con una lona en verano. La correcta es Unos 60 cm (2 pies).")], tip: T("It needs to pull air in through its sides. Crowding it makes it work harder.", "Necesita jalar aire por los lados. Si la encierras, trabaja más.")});
