  put("You smell gas in the house. What do you do first?", {q: T("You smell gas in the house. What do you do first?", "You smell gas in the house. What do you do first?"), a: [T("Get everyone outside", "Sacar a todos afuera"), T("Turn on the lights to look", "Prender la luz para buscar"), T("Call from the kitchen", "Llamar desde la cocina"), T("Open the furnace panel", "Abrir el panel del calefactor")], c: 0, why: T("Leave first. Switches and phones can spark. Call once you are outside.", "Sal primero. Los interruptores y teléfonos pueden hacer chispa. Llama ya estando afuera."), wrong: ["", T("Not Turn on the lights to look. The right call is Get everyone outside.", "No es Prender la luz para buscar. La correcta es Sacar a todos afuera."), T("Not Call from the kitchen. The right call is Get everyone outside.", "No es Llamar desde la cocina. La correcta es Sacar a todos afuera."), T("Not Open the furnace panel. The right call is Get everyone outside.", "No es Abrir el panel del calefactor. La correcta es Sacar a todos afuera.")], tip: T("Leave first. Switches and phones can spark. Call once you are outside.", "Sal primero. Los interruptores y teléfonos pueden hacer chispa. Llama ya estando afuera.")});
