  put("In cooling, the air from the vents is usually how much colder than the return air?", {q: T("In cooling, the air from the vents is usually how much colder than the return air?", "En modo frío, ¿qué tanto más frío sale el aire que el de retorno, normalmente?"), a: [T("About 15–20°F", "Unos 15–20°F"), T("About 1–2°F", "Unos 1–2°F"), T("About 50°F", "Unos 50°F"), T("It should be the same", "Debe ser igual")], c: 0, why: T("A 15–20°F drop across the coil is the common rule of thumb.", "Una baja de 15–20°F en el serpentín es la regla común."), wrong: ["", T("Not About 1–2°F. The right call is About 15–20°F.", "No es Unos 1–2°F. La correcta es Unos 15–20°F."), T("Not About 50°F. The right call is About 15–20°F.", "No es Unos 50°F. La correcta es Unos 15–20°F."), T("Not It should be the same. The right call is About 15–20°F.", "No es Debe ser igual. La correcta es Unos 15–20°F.")], tip: T("A 15–20°F drop across the coil is the common rule of thumb.", "Una baja de 15–20°F en el serpentín es la regla común.")});
